================ PRE-REGISTERED VERDICTS ================
S1 correlation fooled (variant A):            PASS
S2 contrast rejects decoy (variant A):        FAIL
S3 true edges survive contrast (variant A):   PASS
S4 boundary: unkeyed confounder fools contrast (variant B): PREDICTION CONFIRMED
S5 interventional oracle agrees:              PASS (P(ring|do(grasp))=0.515, P(ring|do(wait))=0.515, P(ate|do(eat))=0.995)
S6a per-context contrast, CURRENT ctx key: decoy accepted in 3/3 seeds -> per-context alone does NOT fix it
S6b glow-augmented ctx key, existing pooled contrast: decoy rejected AND true edges kept in 0/3 seeds -> fix does NOT work
OVERALL: v2 decoy separates causal/correlational at toy scale: NO (S1&S2&S3&S5)
VERDICT FOR V2: the decoy design bites (S1) but the CURRENT identifier accepts the decoy (S2) -> building the full matrix now would repeat emca == emca_nocausal; build v2 ONLY with the S6b context fix (which did NOT validate - redesign needed)
